WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Your car is considered an old model.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,200
Fortunately, this car is very fuel-efficient.

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,320
Well maintained too

4
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,600
No big accidents happened

5
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:07,880
The most I can give you is fifteen thousand

6
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,440
If you think this price is okay

7
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:13,300
You can sign the contract now and close the deal

8
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,180
If the car is gone, it's gone.

9
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:22,330
My daughter can’t go hungry with me

10
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,420
This Ling girl is really willing to give up

11
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,460
I remember that a box of milk cost a little less than 200.

12
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:31,500
I can't bear to buy it

13
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,820
She actually bought two boxes at once

14
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,900
Spending money so lavishly

15
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,060
Sooner or later, I'll be living on the streets

16
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:46,630
Look what dad bought you. Host

17
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:47,870
Today’s task has been released

18
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:51,310
Please lead Ling's daughter to complete at least three assistants, nicknamed Comrade Xiaoyu

19
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:55,980
Now there is an important task for you in the organization. Are you confident that you can complete it? Now come down.

20
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:57,660
Do three auxiliary evil words to show me your determination.

21
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:59,700
I do evil and call my father bad

22
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:01,860
They haven't had breakfast yet, as long as you do it

23
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:09,340
I allow you to eat an extra bag of potato chips today. Dad will give you one, two and one more potato chips.
